  <item>
    <title>评《奥本海默》，就算你是蝙蝠侠，也得开会喝茶</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64cfe55ee490c5dee5ba654c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64cfe55ee490c5dee5ba654c</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 07 Aug 2023 15:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><em><span>“此时此刻，全世界或许都能和《芭比》</span></em><span>产生</span><em><span>共鸣，但在不同国家地区，《奥本海默》会指向完全不同的含义。”</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>7月，NaNa和马达在香港看了《奥本海默》，而“真诺粉”豆sir，却因证件过期被半路拦截，未能赴约。</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>于是，我们有了这场关于《奥本海默》的闲聊。</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>别怕剧透，对于这部电影，剧透，是好事。</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>本期巴托比：</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>马达：青年导演，正在打工。</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>NaNa：青年导演，来自香港。</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>豆子：青年导演，来自台湾。</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>节目详情：</span></em></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Part Ⅰ：吹水</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>（<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>~<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="785">13:05</a>）</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>（<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>）香港观影与“芭比海默”</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>油尖旺，IMAX+35mm</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>北京，《芭比》和《封神》，直男选后者</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>（<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="345">05:45</a>）《奥本海默》初印象</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>《奥本海默》，Nana的最爱</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>《信条》后的新风向</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>（<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="415">06:55</a>）在座各位对诺兰电影的喜恶</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>《信条》攻防战</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>《蝙蝠侠系列》首尾皆占</span></em></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Part Ⅱ：《奥本海默》新诺兰</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>（<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="800">13:20</a>~<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2305">38:25</a>）</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>（<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="800">13:20</a>）黑白加彩色？不啃书能看电影吗？</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>只看了两页原著，钢铁侠变男同</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>都是二战，相比《敦刻尔克》难懂吗</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>（<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1100">18:20</a>）人至中年，诺兰还是时间管理大师？</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>鞭尸《信条》，这次剪辑，詹妮弗·拉梅立大功</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>路易维格·格兰森配乐，夜店DJ勇闯金色大厅</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>（<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1750">29:10</a>）新团队，帮诺兰进入抖音时代？</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>《奥本海默》，原子信息轰炸</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>简评原声带，格兰森与诺兰相互奔赴</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>（<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2180">36:20</a>）宣发形象改头换面，诺兰老木逢春？</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>首映与好莱坞罢工</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>英国佬重新做人</span></em></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Part Ⅲ：老白男与裸体戏</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>（<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2320">38:40</a>~<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3137">52:17</a>）</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>（<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2320">38:40</a>）诺兰拍女性角色最好的一次？</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>弗伦西斯·皮尤，豆sir的信条</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>他真的已经尽力了，吗</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>（<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2580">43:00</a>）《奥本海默》中的女性角色塑造有何不同？</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>规则和系统之外</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>猫女和老白男</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>（<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2810">46:50</a>）R级片？全裸是否必要？</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>《薄伽梵歌》与第一场裸体戏</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>事后烟，还是啥都不能说</span></em></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Part Ⅳ：指指点点</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>（<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3180">53:00</a>~<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4865">81:05</a>）</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>（<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3180">53:00</a>）评分，先评《芭比》，再评《奥本海默》</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>暴论大战理中客</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>再次鞭尸《信条》</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>（<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3400">56:40</a>）优点，最大优点是表演？</span></p><span></span><p><span>基利安·</span><em><span>墨菲：人类恐惧时刻长啥样</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>三大影帝，不务正业萨弗迪</span><